                "text": "**Analyzing Transformations**\n\nI'm currently focused on how a 2x2 input matrix transforms into a 4x4 output. I'm noticing a tiling pattern; however, the actual transformations seem a little odd. Taking a closer look, the top-left 2x2 block isn't a direct copy, but a modified version of the input data. Now I'm starting to think the 2x2 block might be tiled as well.\n\n\n**Identifying the Projection**\n\nI've realized the transformation involves vertical column projections. If a column in the input has any non-zero elements, all zeros in the corresponding output column become 8. This happens regardless of the non-zero element's location. This explains the 0s turning into 8s!\n\n\n",
